---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout>
	<!-- Hero Section -->
	<section class="relative bg-[url('https://static.wixstatic.com/media/4e60ed_e6b2c286d9a14de8bf696cbab9338f0d~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_1894,h_880,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_auto/4e60ed_e6b2c286d9a14de8bf696cbab9338f0d~mv2.jpg')] bg-cover bg-center py-20 lg:py-40 flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center px-4">
		<div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black bg-opacity-40"></div>
		<div class="relative z-10 text-white">
			<h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight mb-4">함께 울고 함께 웃는 예봄교회</h1>
			<p class="text-lg md:text-xl max-w-2xl mt-4 leading-relaxed font-light">
				함께 울고 웃는 예봄교회 가족들이 예수님을 함께 닮아가며 신약교회의 회복을 꿈꾸고 있습니다.
			</p>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- Mission Statement -->
	<section class="py-20 bg-white px-4">
		<div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center">
			<h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 tracking-wider">MISSION STATEMENT</h2>
			<p class="text-gray-800 text-xl mb-6 font-medium">
				예수그리스도를 알지 못하는 이웃에게 생명의 복음을 전하여 하나님을 예배하게 하고 말씀으로 훈련하여 하나님과 교회와 세상을 섬기며 살게 한다.
			</p>
			<p class="text-gray-500 italic mb-10">
				Our mission is to spread the gospel of life to neighbors who do not know Jesus Christ. It also makes them worship God and trains them with the Word. So they serve God, the church, and the world.
			</p>
			<div>
				<a href="/about" class="inline-block border border-gray-900 text-gray-900 font-medium py-3 px-8 hover:bg-gray-900 hover:text-white transition duration-300">ABOUT YEBOM</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- Bible Verse Section -->
	<section class="py-20 bg-[#f7f7f7] px-4 text-center">
		<div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
			<p class="text-2xl text-gray-800 leading-relaxed font-serif font-light mb-6">
				"여호와는 네게 복을 주시고 너를 지키시기를 원하며 여호와는 그의 얼굴을 네게 비추사 은혜 베푸시기를 원하며 여호와는 그 얼굴을 네게로 향하여 드사 평강 주시기를 원하노라"
			</p>
			<p class="mt-4 text-gray-600 font-medium">- 민수기 6:24-26 -</p>
		</div>
	</section>
</Layout>
